<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
	Track was pinned on purpose rather than merely cached by playing it, so it survives
	a cache trim. Same solid red cloud with a download arrow on it: still reads as "on
	the device" from across the row, and the arrow tells the two apart up close.

	The arrow is white rather than knocked out to the background: themes here are picked
	at runtime, not by a -night qualifier, so there is no one background colour a hole
	could be painted in. Sitting on top of the red fill, it only has to contrast with
	the cloud, which white does under every theme.
-->
